{"results": [{"name": "Lume Deodorant", "entity_id": "0FFCA64B-F105-4D8C-BCF5-744D6BEF48FB", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Lume Deodorant is a personal care company that revolutionized the deodorant category by introducing the first clinically proven whole-body deodorant. Founded by an OB/GYN, the brand leverages mandelic acid to address the root cause of odor-causing bacteria rather than masking it with synthetic fragrances. Known for its gentle, skin-friendly formula that is free of aluminum and baking soda, it serves consumers seeking reliable protection in diverse contexts. With a strong cult following, the brand emphasizes transparency, scientific testing, and long-lasting performance for all areas of the body.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "lumedeodorant"}, "twitter": {"id": "lumedeodorant"}}, "founded_year": "2017", "short_description": "Lume Deodorant is a personal care brand offering whole body deodorants with 72-hour odor control, available in solid stick, cream tube, and spray forms.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "fr", "value": "Un déodorant corps entier cliniquement prouvé, développé par des gynécologues, qui prévient les odeurs dès leur origine grâce à une formule douce à base d'acides."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A clinically proven, OB/GYN-developed whole-body deodorant that prevents odor-causing bacteria before it starts using a gentle, acid-based formula."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Un desodorante para todo el cuerpo, desarrollado por ginecólogos y clínicamente probado, que previene el mal olor desde su origen con una fórmula suave y eficaz basada en ácidos."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Ein klinisch erprobtes, von Gynäkologen entwickeltes Ganzkörper-Deodorant, das Gerüche dank einer sanften, säurebasierten Formel bereits bei der Entstehung verhindert."}], "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/0FFCA64B-F105-4D8C-BCF5-744D6BEF48FB-420x-auto.jpg"}}, "popularity": 0.84199284636639